AWS_NOTES.md

# Helm values file with real generated values (RDS endpoint, S3 bucket, AWS
# account ID, credentials) - setup.sh writes this fresh each run as a temp
# file that's deleted right after use, but kept here in case anyone generates
# one manually at a tracked path instead.
helm/values-dynamic.yaml
!helm/values-dynamic.example.yaml
